  message: "Merged 63ab6d8727. PHP use-statement import-promotion chain: (A) php.py emits imports edges per 'use Namespace\\Class;' (was zero); (B) profile.py _module_match_kind/_is_specific_pattern learn the '\\' separator; (C) PHP_FRAMEWORKS carry import namespaces (Illuminate->laravel, Symfony, Cake, yii, Slim, Phalcon, CodeIgniter). RED/GREEN: matcher tests + refine_frameworks promote test (synthetic edge) + php.py emitter test. Manifest-less PHP app now promotes its framework via the standard prod-importer+language gate. Core+mainstream 100%."  # 8fc6
